        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    borrowed_amount_jpy = 1_000_000\n    borrowing_rate = 0.005\n    investment_rate = 0.05\n    exchange_rate = 0.05  # Brazilian Reals per Japanese Yen\n\n    # Convert borrowed funds to BRL and calculate the interest-rate spread\n    invested_amount_brl = borrowed_amount_jpy * exchange_rate\n    investment_interest_brl = invested_amount_brl * investment_rate\n    borrowing_interest_brl = (\n        borrowed_amount_jpy * borrowing_rate * exchange_rate\n    )\n    profit_brl = investment_interest_brl - borrowing_interest_brl\n\n    # Return the profit to the nearest integer\n    return round(profit_brl)\n```",
